label story_03_fail (The Living Night Failed)
[style name="Gameplay"]
"Dianthus Core" (Default): Dusk Forest has closed its leaves against us. Not in anger. In fear.
"Dianthus Core": The night-blooming roots are still alive, but I can no longer hear the pattern they were trying to show us.
"Dianthus Core": Stay close to the garden now, little alchemist. If the forest will not open, survival must become our answer, and the answer must have thorns.
